Add a bounded timeout so a genuine hang fails the test instead of hanging CI forever — `await service.Completion.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10))` (that `WaitAsync` is the BCL one in .NET 6+, not the extension method). A timeout failure is real information; a fixed delay is not.

