**What to avoid:** `Thread.Sleep`, a bare `await Task.Delay(200)` "so it finishes," `async void` test methods (a failed assertion inside them is silently swallowed — the runner can't await them), `.Result`/`.Wait()`, and any unbounded wait with no timeout.

